{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash brutal justice as <strong>Night Jackal</strong>, a masked vigilante driven to the edge after a violent assault on his manor leaves his world shattered. All signs point to his arch-nemesis, the elusive Burt the Barbarous\u2014but is there a <i>deeper conspiracy</i> afoot? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Easy FPS Editor, this bite-sized boomer shooter throws you into a retro-fueled rampage of precision firepower, relentless enemies, and a protagonist hell-bent on settling his <strong>blood debt</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brains Meet Bullets:</strong> Balance raw gunplay with stealth, puzzles, underwater mechanics, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Mayhem:</strong> Experience this <strong>original story</strong> of a super hero coming unhinged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Artwork:</strong> Featuring visuals pulled from the Night Jackal comic, including work by industry veteran <strong>Derec Donovan</strong> (<i>Spider-Man, Superman, Wonder Woman</i>). </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Manor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620560/abdf81fcce85e610411a82db6c073776c7707d2e.jpg"},{"name":"Hideout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620560/c753e9d4070b61e0ab6ef7ce321f2551b5d78531.jpg"},{"name":"Paradoxia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620560/4727d206cc08e5413723fb33f28db5c352a4ed72.jpg"},{"name":"Finale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620560/9d3a2e98d3c558261da0cf949a7e76f53c52afe1.jpg"},{"name":"Secrets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620560/398f53e3846443f05b98b9652823b40e7c02ee33.jpg"},{"name":"Minigun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620560/c7ca2375f72f484d4ae